OL,3,GNEWSAPC denies confrontation with care
OL,4,Ahome amputee
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer has denied creating a
OL,7,Fconfrontation between him and a
OL,8,F92-year-old amputee when he drew his
OL,9,Fincapacitating Pava spray and issued an
OL,10,Fultimatum against the care home
OL,11,Fresident who had been threatening staff
OL,12,Fwith a dinner knife, a police
OL,13,Fdisciplinary panel has heard.
OL,15,FPC Stephen Smith, 52, was leading the
OL,16,Fpolice response when he and PC Rachel
OL,17,FComotto arrived at the care home in St
OL,18,FLeonards in 2022 in response to a 999
OL,19,Fcall, the hearing was told.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
